{"id":"f807bc064a4947dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness.md","title":"ZFC L Condensation Witness","display":"df-zfc-l-condensation-witness — ZFC L Condensation Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-l-condensation-witness — ZFC L Condensation Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","[[58-df-elementary.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-l-condensation-witness — ZFC L Condensation Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"58-df-elementary.md\">58-df-elementary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta \\in V\">\\(\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S \\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S \\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}condensation\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S(\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle,\n\\langle L_\\theta,\\in\\cap L_\\theta^2\\rangle,\nL_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,M,L_\\alpha)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=L_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;( \\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\in\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle\\in\\in\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}condensation\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S(\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle,\n\\langle L_\\theta,\\in\\cap L_\\theta^2\\rangle,\nL_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,M,L_\\alpha)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=L_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;( \\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\in\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle\\in\\in\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient constructible level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\theta\">\\(L_\\theta\\)</span> is an explicit parameter, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> is the collapse isomorphism onto a lower constructible level.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S \\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}condensation\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LCondensationWitness}_S(\\pi,M,\\alpha,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\\alpha\\subseteq\\theta\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\n\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle,\n\\langle L_\\theta,\\in\\cap L_\\theta^2\\rangle,\nL_\\in)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,M,L_\\alpha)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=L_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;( \\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\in\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\pi(x),\\pi(y)\\rangle\\in\\in\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness.md|58-df-zfc-l-condensation-witness]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["3743f726a3653802","e91c1261e1c2374b","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}